  "phase3_gemini_self_healing": {
    "forensics": "The strategy achieved positive gross expectancy (+\u20b949.98 gross P&L), but brokerage and statutory fee drag (\u20b954.25) pushed net P&L marginally negative (\u20b9-4.27). Four losses were triggered by exact 0.70% stop-loss whipsaws during the 10:25\u201311:10 IST post-opening liquidity transition, while three late/mid-day entries (ITC, TATASTEEL, ICICIBANK) lacked the momentum to reach the ambitious 1.35% target, decaying into EOD square-offs or breakeven stops where transaction costs eroded small gross gains.",
    "learning": "In NSE large-cap cash equities, intraday momentum decays rapidly after 11:00 IST; requiring an overly wide 1.35% target forces trades to hold through midday mean-reversion and EOD square-offs where fixed fee drag turns flat or mildly positive gross excursions into net losses.",
    "parameter_patch": {
