      "min_sl_pct": 0.75
    },
    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #55 Quantitative Review & Parameter Mutation\nCycle #55 demonstrated strong gross edge (PF 0.97, Gross P&L +\u20b949.98 across 15 trades), proving that the core liquidity-sweep thesis is structurally sound, with only \u20b954.25 in fee drag preventing net profitability. Forensic analysis of the losing cluster revealed two primary microstructure friction points: 0.70% stop-loss whipsaws during the 10:25\u201311:10 IST institutional order-flow transition, and EOD momentum decay on trades failing to reach the 1.35% target. To push the profit factor decisively above 1.15, we are tightening `min_target_pct` to 1.15% to harvest profits before afternoon consolidation, lowering `breakeven_trigger_r` to 1.05R to neutralize fee drag earlier on stalling breakouts, widening `min_sl_pct` to the 0.75% upper bound to survive routine intraday stop-hunts, and elevating `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.90x to filter out low-conviction midday false breaks."
